/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 77 0 R
/T (This report is part of the Post-Control Initiative, developed through the Sentient Futures Project Incubator, which brought together researchers and practitioners for four expert roundtables held on 14, 15, 16, and 20 October 2026. This report focuses on two of these roundtables: Human Value and Claims in a Post-Control Scenario \(15 October\) and What Makes Cooperation Without Control Work \(20 October\). The discussions explored different perspectives on human influence and cooperation, including the difference between recognising human interests and being able to protect them.)
/E (This report is part of the Post-Control Initiative, developed through the Sentient Futures Project Incubator, which brought together researchers and practitioners for four expert roundtables held on 14, 15, 16, and 20 October 2026. This report focuses on two of these roundtables: Human Value and Claims in a Post-Control Scenario \(15 October\) and What Makes Cooperation Without Control Work \(20 October\). The discussions explored different perspectives on human influence and cooperation, including the difference between recognising human interests and being able to protect them.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
