245 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 84 0 R
/E (Other participants questioned how meaningful this autonomy would be if a more powerful system could override human choices at any point. Even if people retained freedom in their everyday lives, that freedom might depend on decisions made by systems beyond their control, leaving them with little ability to challenge unwanted interference. This raised broader questions about consent, the ability to opt out of AI-mediated arrangements and the importance of retaining meaningful alternatives.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
