<<
/Title (The approaches discussed above raise a common question about how cooperation remains reliable over time. Even if humans and advanced AI systems agreed on shared goals or principles, how could we know whether those commitments were being respected, particularly if humans could no longer fully monitor or control the systems involved? Participants discussed possible ways to detect violations, create incentives for cooperation and test whether systems would continue to honour agreements as circumstances changed.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1391 0 R
>>
